        "cooked": "<p>Looking back through the document I found a few errors. Some typos and a few places where I messed up on putting graphics behind text on layers, and one place where I wanted to expand the white space between text and graphics. So, I made a few changes and uploaded a new version of the file. The old one has been removed. You can download the new one here:</p><p><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/wgli2a63cal50d6/FindingFreedomv2.pdf?dl=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/wgli2a63cal50d6/FindingFreedomv2.pdf?dl=0</a></p><p>Please let me know what you think. Thanks!</p>",
